        "PMC5893566::web::019::dislocation_mechanisms_for_fcc_to_hcp_ph"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under identical deformation conditions, CrCoNi will develop a higher HCP phase fraction than CrMnFeCoNi.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
